INTERPRETATION
At K=2Q+2 the odd quotient is JN_1.  The analyzer separates the
shifted terminal kernel into its even- and odd-suffix packets for every
shell and endpoint.  The ten deficit records are exact unbounded
polynomial certificates for Lemma 5A8H28I.  The classification record
exhausts the stable-boundary partition of Lemma 5A8H28J: 145 finite
boundary-box entries, 97 one-variable Newton rays, eight two-variable
Newton cones, and 4,935 independent checks of the explicit outer-odd
formula.  The program reconstructs every sampled value and rejects a
negative coefficient or nonzero sixth difference.  The finite range
audits the quotient recurrence; the degree-five Newton identities give
the unbounded certificate.

